POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "vocês vendem pão de queijo quentinho?"
}

### 19. Guest Flow - Step 1: Start Registration Directly
# @name guestRegistrationRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "guest_demo_client",
    "text": "Quero me registrar"
}

### 20. Guest Flow - Step 2: Choose Plan Professional
# @name guestChoosePlanPro
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "guest_demo_client",
    "text": "Quero o plano professional"
}

### 21. Guest Flow - Step 3: Send Complete Registration Data
# @name guestSendRegistration
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "guest_demo_client",
    "text": "Carlos Silva, CPF 123.456.789-00, carlos@example.com, 5511988887777, Rua das Flores, 120"
}

### 22. Guest Flow - Step 4: Check Signature when Still Pending (System alerts user)
# @name guestCheckPendingSignature
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "guest_demo_client",
    "text": "Já assinei o contrato"
}

### 23. Digital Signature Platform - REST API to Simulate Signing Contract
# @name apiSignContract
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/contract/sign/CONT-729066
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 24. Digital Signature Platform - REST API to Query Contract Status
# @name apiGetContract
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/contract/CONT-729066

### 25. Guest Flow - Step 5: Inform Signed After Real/Simulated Signature (Activates Account)
# @name guestConfirmSignature
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "guest_demo_client",
    "text": "Simular assinatura do contrato"
}

### 26. Operator Console - List All Active Chat Sessions
# @name listChatSessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/sessions

