### 39. Operator History - Includes Confidential Internal Messages
# @name operatorGetHistory
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/history?customerId=5511999999999&scope=operator

### 40. Client History - Confidential Internal Messages are Strictly Filtered Out
# @name clientGetHistory
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/history?customerId=5511999999999&scope=client






